oun","nominative/accusative/genitive plural of Teufelspakt",0]],"inflections":[["teufelspakte","teufelspakt","plural"]]},"zangendeutsch":{"entries":[["zangendeutsch",null,"/ˈtsaŋ.ənˌdɔɪ̯t͡ʃ/","Compound of Zange (“(pair of) pliers”) + -n- + Deutsch (“German”), said to have originated or been popularized on Krautchan, a German-language imageboard created in 2007. Due to its lack of archiving, the exact context of its coining is likely undiscoverable. The word is attested by 2011.\nA possible motivation for the compound is that it involves intentionally atypical word usage and formation in German, metaphorically using tools to bend words into shape—compare mit der Brechzange, a variation of mit der Brechstange (“forced, by brute force”, literally “with the crowbar”). It could also be a play on Angelsächsisch (“Anglo-Saxon”), reinterpreted as Angel (“fishing rod”) + Sächsisch."]],"senses":[[717209,"zangendeutsch","name","The usage of intentionally overly literal translations and phono-semantic matching of English terminology and slang into German, typically for humorous effect.",0,null,["slang","uncommon","Internet"]]]},"herumginge":{"inflections":[["herumginge","herumgehen","first-person,singular,subjunctive,subjunctive-ii,subordinate-clause"]]},"herunterlecktet":{"inflections":[["herunterlecktet","herunterlecken","indicative,plural,preterite,second-person,subordinate-clause"]]},"mattsetze":{"inflections":[["mattsetze","mattsetzen","first-person,indicative,present,singular,subordinate-clause"]]},"meßbuchs":{"inflections":[["meßbuchs","meßbuch","genitive"]]},"seetüchtiges":{"inflections":[["seetüchtiges","seetüchtig","neuter,nominative,singular,strong,without-article"]]},"verbohrend":{"inflections":[["verbohrend","verbohren","participle,present"]]},"wegjagens":{"inflections":[["wegjagens","wegjagen","genitive"]]},"zerschrammtet":{"inflections":[["zerschrammtet","zerschrammen","indicative,plural,preterite,second-person"]]}}}